      "verbatim_texts": [
        "To begin the validation process, start by checking the received invoice for any errors."
      ],
      "justification": "The opening sentence establishes the process initiation, the explicit start command, and the initial error-checking action."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "branch:b1"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "If any errors are found",
        "If no errors are found"
      ],
      "justification": "The paired conditional clauses establish the XOR decision gateway."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "guard:b1->n3"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "any errors are found"
      ],
      "justification": "Corresponds to the positive condition guarding the continuation path."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "guard:b1->n4"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "no errors are found"
      ],
      "justification": "Corresponds to the negative condition guarding the marking path."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "action:n3"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "continue with the process."
      ],
      "justification": "Directly matches the action taken when errors are detected."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "action:n4"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "mark the \"invoice entered correctly\" box."
      ],
      "justification": "Directly matches the action taken when no errors are detected."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "action:n5"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "Simultaneously, highlight any errors on the invoice entry form and keep a record of the DEO's performance."
      ],
      "justification": "Captures the concurrent highlighting and performance-recording steps."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "action:n6"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "the process ends."
      ],
      "justification": "The repeated terminal phrase supports the final end action and structural end node."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "converge:c1"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "Once the \"invoice entered correctly\" box is ticked, the invoice is checked and the process ends.",
        "If an error exists, the process also ends."
      ],
      "justification": "The two distinct paths terminating at the same point imply the convergence gateway."
    }
